## Timing

| Mode | Feels like |
|------|-----------|
| On every keystroke | Hostile — "invalid email" while typing the first letter |
| **On blur, then on change once invalid** | ✅ The standard, and what `mode: 'onTouched'` gives you |
| Only on submit | Fine for short forms; frustrating for long ones |

