## Preview without uploading

```jsx
const [preview, setPreview] = useState(null);

useEffect(() => {
  if (!file) return;
  const url = URL.createObjectURL(file);
  setPreview(url);
  return () => URL.revokeObjectURL(url);   // ← without this you leak memory
}, [file]);

{preview && <img src={preview} alt="Preview" />}
```

Object URLs stay alive until revoked. Forgetting the cleanup leaks the whole file.

